Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

1.
The tape$newton has a number of control options:
https://kaskr.github.io/adcomp/structnewton_1_1newton__config.html
I used the 'trace' argument to realize that a lower gradient tolerance 'grad_tol' was needed by your example:
g <- MakeTape(function(x) f$newton(2, grad_tol=1e-12)(x), numeric(2))

2.
The failing ADjoint was a bug in RTMB (now fixed!).

